{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John! How've you been? Something awesome happened - I'm writing articles about fantasy novels for an online mag. It's so rewarding!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-e58ffe087d7970854a77fd10", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:15.971752+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e58ffe087d7970854a77fd10", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e58ffe087d7970854a77fd10", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! Congrats on the opportunity to write about what you're into! How did it happen?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-4831dc07fe18897eb7f740d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.133375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4831dc07fe18897eb7f740d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4831dc07fe18897eb7f740d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! I found this opportunity on a fantasy lit forum and thought it'd be perfect since I love fantasy. I shared my ideas with the magazine and they liked them! It's been awesome to spread my love of fantasy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-b99f907e7b433d4f08b75c27", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.147562+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b99f907e7b433d4f08b75c27", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b99f907e7b433d4f08b75c27", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Congratulations! That's awesome. What kind of articles have you been writing?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-c9346999c086cc8a94ca1ae8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.159669+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c9346999c086cc8a94ca1ae8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c9346999c086cc8a94ca1ae8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! I've been writing about different fantasy novels, studying characters, themes, and making book recommendations."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-12adec97bf18281d822c3b3c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.172417+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "12adec97bf18281d822c3b3c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "12adec97bf18281d822c3b3c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Awesome! Must be so rewarding to delve into your books and chat about them. Do you have any favorite books you love writing about?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-61581b2ce377fc29def795e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.185469+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "61581b2ce377fc29def795e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "61581b2ce377fc29def795e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: For sure! Harry Potter and Game of Thrones are amazing - I'm totally hooked! I could chat about them forever!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-8e1971bb9a3b836b2f1ae2fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.197640+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8e1971bb9a3b836b2f1ae2fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8e1971bb9a3b836b2f1ae2fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Oh yeah, I remember you telling me about Harry Potter! I've got a funny story. Anthony and I went to this charity thing and ended up in this intense Harry Potter trivia contest. We did alright, but there was this one super-nerd there that took home this as a prize."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-54ffe68d67b6d2f350ab4471", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.209964+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54ffe68d67b6d2f350ab4471", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54ffe68d67b6d2f350ab4471", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: That looks great! The signature is sweet! Have you been reading anything?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-a4da5c6cc0fe8a02d0a975e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.224571+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a4da5c6cc0fe8a02d0a975e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a4da5c6cc0fe8a02d0a975e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've been reading this inspiring book, it reminds me to keep dreaming."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-f87c3f415c1b4a983c08ac26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.235171+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f87c3f415c1b4a983c08ac26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f87c3f415c1b4a983c08ac26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Books can really inspire and help us keep our dreams alive. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-1a5b52fefd3fffca0682717d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.246716+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a5b52fefd3fffca0682717d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a5b52fefd3fffca0682717d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! They really do. I want to keep reaching for new goals."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-6384719465bdf9dec89803af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.258937+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6384719465bdf9dec89803af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6384719465bdf9dec89803af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Same here!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-f03c5b73e604e840322cfffa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.268147+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f03c5b73e604e840322cfffa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f03c5b73e604e840322cfffa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Have fun with your writing! Catch you later!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-689a5331e0034ddc08d03e3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.281580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "689a5331e0034ddc08d03e3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "689a5331e0034ddc08d03e3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! I'll enjoy writing them. Take care and talk soon!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-43/session_4-324fd1ca3d8a62233261a4e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.293805+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "324fd1ca3d8a62233261a4e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "324fd1ca3d8a62233261a4e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
